# AI Operating Process Adapter For Claude Code

Use the AI Operating Process as the repository's reusable operating context.

At the start of non-trivial work:

1. Read the core index.
2. Choose a work mode.
3. Load only the project context and routine needed for the request.
4. Keep project-specific instructions in this repository and general operating rules in the process folder.

For live work, run preflight and stop for approval gates. For handoffs or compaction, write a dated state note and verify it by reading it back.

Process location: `[replace with the path to your AI Operating Process]`
